      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kinds of Language Processors",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kinds of Language Processors",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UlDaxfwXNqzpWPou4s_bl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5062.595261945469,
      "y": 2420.7509578338036,
      "width": 1235.9984130859375,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1906437472,
      "version": 332,
      "versionNonce": 94928220,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789462811599,
      "created": 1789447433617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "┌───────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Category                │ Dhamdhere Functional Definition & Role                                             │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. Program Generator    │ Accepts a problem-oriented specification and automatically generates an            │\n│                         │ equivalent program in a target procedure-oriented language [17-19].                │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. Language Translator  │ Translates a source program written in a PL into an equivalent target              │\n│                         │ program in machine or assembly language [17, 20].                                  │\n│   • Compiler            │ A translator whose source language is NOT assembly language (e.g. C → Bin)         │\n│                         │ [17, 20].                                                                          │\n│   • Assembler           │ A translator whose source language IS assembly language [17, 20].                  │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. Interpreter          │ Analyzes and directly executes source statements line-by-line without              │\n│                         │ generating an independent target machine code file [17, 21].                       │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. Preprocessor         │ Performs source-to-source transformations (macro expansion, file inclusion)        │\n│                         │ before passing clean source text to a compiler [1, 20].                            │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. Language Migrator    │ Translates a program from one high-level PL to another PL (e.g. COBOL → C#)        │\n│                         │ to port software to modern platforms [1, 20, 22].                                  │\n└───────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "┌───────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Category                │ Dhamdhere Functional Definition & Role                                             │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. Program Generator    │ Accepts a problem-oriented specification and automatically generates an            │\n│                         │ equivalent program in a target procedure-oriented language [17-19].                │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. Language Translator  │ Translates a source program written in a PL into an equivalent target              │\n│                         │ program in machine or assembly language [17, 20].                                  │\n│   • Compiler            │ A translator whose source language is NOT assembly language (e.g. C → Bin)         │\n│                         │ [17, 20].                                                                          │\n│   • Assembler           │ A translator whose source language IS assembly language [17, 20].                  │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. Interpreter          │ Analyzes and directly executes source statements line-by-line without              │\n│                         │ generating an independent target machine code file [17, 21].                       │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. Preprocessor         │ Performs source-to-source transformations (macro expansion, file inclusion)        │\n│                         │ before passing clean source text to a compiler [1, 20].                            │\n├───────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. Language Migrator    │ Translates a program from one high-level PL to another PL (e.g. COBOL → C#)        │\n│                         │ to port software to modern platforms [1, 20, 22].                                  │\n└───────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VYGSyiH4cHB_KLSysDI1y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5202.147670869148,
      "y": 2976.5185949696283,
      "width": 993.9989013671875,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 901595488,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 2129162716,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789462811599,
      "created": 1789447433617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROGRAM TRANSLATION MODEL:\n  Source Code ────► [ Translator ] ────► Target Machine Code File ────► [ CPU Execution ]\n                          │\n                          └─► Errors (Requires Re-translation if modified)\n\nPROGRAM INTERPRETATION MODEL:\n  Source Code ──┐\n                ├──► [ Interpreter ] ────► Direct Computation / Results\n  Input Data  ──┘    (Translates & executes statement-by-statement in memory)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PROGRAM TRANSLATION MODEL:\n  Source Code ────► [ Translator ] ────► Target Machine Code File ────► [ CPU Execution ]\n                          │\n                          └─► Errors (Requires Re-translation if modified)\n\nPROGRAM INTERPRETATION MODEL:\n  Source Code ──┐\n                ├──► [ Interpreter ] ────► Direct Computation / Results\n  Input Data  ──┘    (Translates & executes statement-by-statement in memory)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
