      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789465418211,
      "created": 1789463984658,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example: total = price + 2 * qty;\nbecomes: ⟨ID, #1⟩ ⟨ASSIGN_OP⟩\n⟨ID, #2⟩ ⟨ADD_OP⟩ ⟨NUM, 2⟩\n⟨MULT_OP⟩ ⟨ID, #3⟩",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example: total = price + 2 * qty; becomes: ⟨ID, #1⟩ ⟨ASSIGN_OP⟩ ⟨ID, #2⟩ ⟨ADD_OP⟩ ⟨NUM, 2⟩ ⟨MULT_OP⟩ ⟨ID, #3⟩",
