      "type": "text",
      "x": 8623.049301860863,
      "y": 2973.3583321911005,
      "width": 1649.997802734375,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b48",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1065392004,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 67916988,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789614123130,
      "created": 1789614121694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Static Memory Allocation Model\nMechanism: Memory is allocated to variables before program execution begins (during compilation/assembly). Bindings remain fixed throughout execution.\nAdvantages: Fast execution speed—variables are accessed directly using absolute addresses or fixed static offsets without pointer overhead.\nLimitations:\nCannot support recursion (multiple active invocations of a function would overwrite the single static memory area).\nCannot support dynamically-sized data structures (e.g., array bounds determined at runtime).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " Static Memory Allocation Model\nMechanism: Memory is allocated to variables before program execution begins (during compilation/assembly). Bindings remain fixed throughout execution.\nAdvantages: Fast execution speed—variables are accessed directly using absolute addresses or fixed static offsets without pointer overhead.\nLimitations:\nCannot support recursion (multiple active invocations of a function would overwrite the single static memory area).\nCannot support dynamically-sized data structures (e.g., array bounds determined at runtime).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
