    {
      "id": "c-ddyH_FOIE0M7hsYzsNt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8243.456613924218,
      "y": 3390.880370948997,
      "width": 769.9989624023438,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 472975932,
      "version": 108,
      "versionNonce": 987732668,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789614197693,
      "created": 1789614187385,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dynamic Memory Allocation ModelMechanism: Memory bindings are\nestablished and destroyed during program execution.Flavors of Dynamic\nAllocation:Automatic Dynamic Allocation: Memory is allocated when a\nprogram unit (function/block) is entered and automatically deallocated\nupon exit. Follows a LIFO (Last-In-First-Out) lifetime pattern\n$\\implies$ Implemented using a Stack.Program-Controlled Dynamic\nAllocation: The program explicitly requests and releases memory at\narbitrary points during execution (e.g., malloc()/free() in C,\nnew/dispose in Pascal/C++). Lifetimes are arbitrary $\\implies$\nImplemented using a Heap.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dynamic Memory Allocation ModelMechanism: Memory bindings are established and destroyed during program execution.Flavors of Dynamic Allocation:Automatic Dynamic Allocation: Memory is allocated when a program unit (function/block) is entered and automatically deallocated upon exit. Follows a LIFO (Last-In-First-Out) lifetime pattern $\\implies$ Implemented using a Stack.Program-Controlled Dynamic Allocation: The program explicitly requests and releases memory at arbitrary points during execution (e.g., malloc()/free() in C, new/dispose in Pascal/C++). Lifetimes are arbitrary $\\implies$ Implemented using a Heap.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Iy_FnrR_lsiJBxWVipPA6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8599.224398789069,
      "y": 3407.313547583017,
      "width": 769.9989624023438,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 210574268,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 1602033156,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "6fDdX5amiSno95fgWDqeU",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1789614451022,
      "created": 1789614198969,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dynamic Memory Allocation Model\n\nMechanism: Memory bindings are established and destroyed during program\nexecution.\n\nFlavors of Dynamic Allocation:\n\n  Automatic Dynamic Allocation: Memory is allocated when a program unit\n(function/block) is entered and automatically deallocated upon exit. Follows a\nLIFO (Last-In-First-Out) lifetime pattern $\\implies$ Implemented using a\nStack.\n\n  Program-Controlled Dynamic Allocation: The program explicitly requests and\nreleases memory at arbitrary points during execution (e.g., malloc()/free() in C,\nnew/dispose in Pascal/C++). Lifetimes are arbitrary $\\implies$ Implemented\nusing a Heap.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dynamic Memory Allocation Model\n\nMechanism: Memory bindings are established and destroyed during program execution.\n\nFlavors of Dynamic Allocation:\n\n  Automatic Dynamic Allocation: Memory is allocated when a program unit (function/block) is entered and automatically deallocated upon exit. Follows a LIFO (Last-In-First-Out) lifetime pattern $\\implies$ Implemented using a Stack.\n\n  Program-Controlled Dynamic Allocation: The program explicitly requests and releases memory at arbitrary points during execution (e.g., malloc()/free() in C, new/dispose in Pascal/C++). Lifetimes are arbitrary $\\implies$ Implemented using a Heap.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5RdYzYFnF7Wqxn27i8kA3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9367.80918683388,
      "y": 2618.3803843752485,
      "width": 438.01959228515625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1885689988,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 399660932,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789614375796,
      "created": 1789614328602,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "limitations of stack based memory allocation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "limitations of stack based memory allocation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "egMn9jFZjF2GekdZA_4e1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9438.809248244956,
      "y": 2664.6196567975417,
      "width": 780.9989624023438,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 467455036,
      "version": 81,
      "versionNonce": 1445250820,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789614375796,
      "created": 1789614335462,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LIFO Constraint: Stack allocation strictly requires entities to be deallocated in\nreverse order of their allocation. It cannot handle data objects that outlive\nthe function that created them (e.g., dynamic objects returned by a function).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LIFO Constraint: Stack allocation strictly requires entities to be deallocated in reverse order of their allocation. It cannot handle data objects that outlive the function that created them (e.g., dynamic objects returned by a function).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "78_Vwe6Nna_MP7Htit7IZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9446.235936949774,
      "y": 2805.4452842064356,
      "width": 758.9989013671875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1892422972,
      "version": 99,
      "versionNonce": 259868292,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789614375797,
      "created": 1789614343395,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inability to Support Program-Controlled Dynamic Memory: Cannot manage\nrandom allocations and deallocations created via explicit statements like\nmalloc()/free() or new/dispose.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inability to Support Program-Controlled Dynamic Memory: Cannot manage random allocations and deallocations created via explicit statements like malloc()/free() or new/dispose.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IkECjrcdamycT-UzrK2wI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9457.347530973242,
      "y": 2932.414300437883,
      "width": 758.9989624023438,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2038979332,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 412734980,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789614375797,
      "created": 1789614351966,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inadequate for Concurrent / Multi-Threaded Execution: In concurrent\nsystems, threads enter and exit program blocks asynchronously in non-LIFO\norder, breaking the single linear stack assumption.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inadequate for Concurrent / Multi-Threaded Execution: In concurrent systems, threads enter and exit program blocks asynchronously in non-LIFO order, breaking the single linear stack assumption.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oTDyJrt012mhGyJzF-QZq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9502.132803548444,
      "y": 3143.4474597072817,
      "width": 797.5792236328125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 706712452,
      "version": 35,
      "versionNonce": 1728900412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "HuFvvIN1ZI9rJfgC1CHwL",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1789614437919,
      "created": 1789614421121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Static Binding: A memory binding established before execution begins (during\ncompilation/assembly). The association between a variable name and its memory\naddress remains fixed throughout program execution. (e.g., global/static variables\nin C, FORTRAN variables).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Static Binding: A memory binding established before execution begins (during compilation/assembly). The association between a variable name and its memory address remains fixed throughout program execution. (e.g., global/static variables in C, FORTRAN variables).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Dh5rQKYxg8VYgDVNiofRl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9503.958512605914,
      "y": 3315.6881293551737,
      "width": 778.8792114257812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1577789628,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 2004682044,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "6fDdX5amiSno95fgWDqeU",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1789614440772,
      "created": 1789614430952,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dynamic Binding: A memory binding established or changed during program\nexecution. Memory is allocated when a function is called or an explicit allocation\nstatement is executed, and destroyed upon exit or deallocation. (e.g., local\nvariables in recursive functions, heap memory allocated via malloc()).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dynamic Binding: A memory binding established or changed during program execution. Memory is allocated when a function is called or an explicit allocation statement is executed, and destroyed upon exit or deallocation. (e.g., local variables in recursive functions, heap memory allocated via malloc()).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
