      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1020985020,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 1223228092,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "AVfhKc8nOUsBkD_txRSpQ",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "Y1xsq19eYzYVK7MQHUnfp",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "mMuE_TxTdaqSCn5TyvJc8",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1789616712657,
      "created": 1789615035640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Compared to raw machine language, it\nprovides three fundamental features that\nsimplify programming",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Compared to raw machine language, it provides three fundamental features that simplify programming",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2Ff8uv7sRkC4gGic-9tC3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3663.628339589791,
      "y": 4411.8046764342735,
      "width": 403.2996826171875,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2065788476,
      "version": 81,
      "versionNonce": 1945256764,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "AVfhKc8nOUsBkD_txRSpQ",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1789616712657,
      "created": 1789615788807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mnemonic Operation Codes: Replaces\nnumeric opcodes (e.g., 04) with symbolic\nnames (e.g., MOVER), eliminating the need\nto memorize numeric codes and enabling\nhelpful preprocessor diagnostics",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mnemonic Operation Codes: Replaces numeric opcodes (e.g., 04) with symbolic names (e.g., MOVER), eliminating the need to memorize numeric codes and enabling helpful preprocessor diagnostics",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dTeFT79aIxvnO5F40-xo4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2996.6882344983505,
      "y": 4396.8685968888185,
      "width": 402.71966552734375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 659063556,
      "version": 43,
      "versionNonce": 1775534468,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789615803137,
      "created": 1789615795848,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Symbolic Operands: Symbolic names can be\nassociated with data or instructions",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Symbolic Operands: Symbolic names can be associated with data or instructions",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "J58GuDoH4tEPRA8G_es9e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000.9782430432724,
      "y": 4431.8685968888185,
      "width": 394.1396484375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 834150204,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 751913148,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789615803137,
      "created": 1789615795848,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ". The assembler performs memory binding\nto these names automatically so the\nprogrammer does not need to manage\nabsolute memory addresses",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ". The assembler performs memory binding to these names automatically so the programmer does not need to manage absolute memory addresses",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QnCnsfXp9a54furYz5LGj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4120.6013343074765,
      "y": 4425.4481423433635,
      "width": 371.6672696200285,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 303316996,
      "version": 234,
      "versionNonce": 1874754492,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "mMuE_TxTdaqSCn5TyvJc8",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1789616712657,
      "created": 1789615803953,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Symbolic Operands: Symbolic names\ncan be associated with data or\ninstructions\nThe assembler performs memory\nbinding to these names automatically\nso the programmer does not need to\nmanage absolute memory addresses",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Symbolic Operands: Symbolic names can be associated with data or instructions\nThe assembler performs memory binding to these names automatically so the programmer does not need to manage absolute memory addresses",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
