      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                       +-----------------------------------------------+\n                       |          ASSEMBLY STATEMENT TYPES             |\n                       +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                               |\n       +---------------------------------------+-----------------------+\n       |                                       |                       |\n       v                                       v                       v\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n|  1. IMPERATIVE STATEMENTS    |  2. DECLARATION STATEMENTS   |   3. ASSEMBLER DIRECTIVES    |\n|  (Translated to Machine Code)|  (Allocates/Initializes RAM) |   (Directs Assembler Actions)|\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                       +-----------------------------------------------+\n                       |          ASSEMBLY STATEMENT TYPES             |\n                       +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                               |\n       +---------------------------------------+-----------------------+\n       |                                       |                       |\n       v                                       v                       v\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n|  1. IMPERATIVE STATEMENTS    |  2. DECLARATION STATEMENTS   |   3. ASSEMBLER DIRECTIVES    |\n|  (Translated to Machine Code)|  (Allocates/Initializes RAM) |   (Directs Assembler Actions)|\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+",
