      "text": "               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |             Source Program File               |\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |          PASS I (Analysis & LC Processing)    |\n               |  * Builds SYMTAB, LITTAB, POOLTAB             |\n               |  * Emits Intermediate Code (IC)               |\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               | Intermediate Code (IC) + Completed Data Tables|\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |         PASS II (Synthesis & Code Emission)   |\n               |  * Looks up addresses from SYMTAB/LITTAB      |\n               |  * Emits Target Machine Instructions          |\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |             Target Machine Code File          |\n               +-----------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |             Source Program File               |\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |          PASS I (Analysis & LC Processing)    |\n               |  * Builds SYMTAB, LITTAB, POOLTAB             |\n               |  * Emits Intermediate Code (IC)               |\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               | Intermediate Code (IC) + Completed Data Tables|\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |         PASS II (Synthesis & Code Emission)   |\n               |  * Looks up addresses from SYMTAB/LITTAB      |\n               |  * Emits Target Machine Instructions          |\n               +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                       |\n                                       v\n               +-----------------------------------------------+\n               |             Target Machine Code File          |\n               +-----------------------------------------------+",
