        {
          "id": "fdHaXoPx5rpWDrREAgB8q",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1789618659425,
      "created": 1789617494366,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+---------+------+---------------+-------------------+-----------------------------------+\n| Line #  | LC   | Label         | Opcode / Operand  | Description / Trace Action        |\n+---------+------+---------------+-------------------+-----------------------------------+\n| 1       | 200  | -             | START 200         | Set Location Counter to 200       |\n| 2       | 200  | -             | MOVER AREG, ='5'  | ='5' added to LITTAB (#1)         |\n| 3       | 201  | -             | MOVEM AREG, M     | M entered into SYMTAB             |\n| 4       | 202  | L1            | MOVER AREG, ='2'  | L1 = 202, ='2' added to LITTAB (#2) |\n| 5       | -    | -             | ORIGIN L1+3       | LC updated to 202 + 3 = 205       |\n| 6       | 205  | -             | LTORG             | Pool #1: Assign addresses 205-206 |\n| 7       | 207  | NEXT          | ADD AREG, ='1'    | NEXT = 207, ='1' added to LITTAB  |\n| 8       | 208  | -             | SUB BREG, ='2'    | ='2' added to LITTAB (#4)         |\n| 9       | 209  | -             | BC LT, BACK       | BACK entered into SYMTAB          |\n| 10      | 210  | -             | LTORG             | Pool #2: Assign addresses 210-211 |\n| 11      | -    | BACK          | EQU L1            | BACK equated to L1 (202)          |\n| 12      | -    | -             | ORIGIN NEXT+5     | LC updated to 207 + 5 = 212       |\n| 13      | 212  | -             | MULT CREG, ='4'   | ='4' added to LITTAB (#5)         |\n| 14      | 213  | -             | STOP              | Machine stop instruction          |\n| 15      | 214  | M             | DS 1              | M allocated 1 word (Address 214)  |\n| 16      | 215  | -             | END               | Pool #3: Assign address 215 for ='4'|\n+---------+------+---------------+-------------------+-----------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+---------+------+---------------+-------------------+-----------------------------------+\n| Line #  | LC   | Label         | Opcode / Operand  | Description / Trace Action        |\n+---------+------+---------------+-------------------+-----------------------------------+\n| 1       | 200  | -             | START 200         | Set Location Counter to 200       |\n| 2       | 200  | -             | MOVER AREG, ='5'  | ='5' added to LITTAB (#1)         |\n| 3       | 201  | -             | MOVEM AREG, M     | M entered into SYMTAB             |\n| 4       | 202  | L1            | MOVER AREG, ='2'  | L1 = 202, ='2' added to LITTAB (#2) |\n| 5       | -    | -             | ORIGIN L1+3       | LC updated to 202 + 3 = 205       |\n| 6       | 205  | -             | LTORG             | Pool #1: Assign addresses 205-206 |\n| 7       | 207  | NEXT          | ADD AREG, ='1'    | NEXT = 207, ='1' added to LITTAB  |\n| 8       | 208  | -             | SUB BREG, ='2'    | ='2' added to LITTAB (#4)         |\n| 9       | 209  | -             | BC LT, BACK       | BACK entered into SYMTAB          |\n| 10      | 210  | -             | LTORG             | Pool #2: Assign addresses 210-211 |\n| 11      | -    | BACK          | EQU L1            | BACK equated to L1 (202)          |\n| 12      | -    | -             | ORIGIN NEXT+5     | LC updated to 207 + 5 = 212       |\n| 13      | 212  | -             | MULT CREG, ='4'   | ='4' added to LITTAB (#5)         |\n| 14      | 213  | -             | STOP              | Machine stop instruction          |\n| 15      | 214  | M             | DS 1              | M allocated 1 word (Address 214)  |\n| 16      | 215  | -             | END               | Pool #3: Assign address 215 for ='4'|\n+---------+------+---------------+-------------------+-----------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
