      "text": "                       +-----------------------------------------------+\n                       |           ASSEMBLER DESIGN OPTIONS            |\n                       +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                               |\n       +---------------------------------------+-----------------------+\n       |                                       |                       |\n       v                                       v                       v\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n|  1. NUMBER OF PASSES         |  2. INTERMEDIATE CODE FORMAT |  3. INTEGRATION LEVEL        |\n|  (1-Pass vs. 2-Pass)         |  (Variant I vs. Variant II)  |  (Separate vs. Integrated)   |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                       +-----------------------------------------------+\n                       |           ASSEMBLER DESIGN OPTIONS            |\n                       +-----------------------+-----------------------+\n                                               |\n       +---------------------------------------+-----------------------+\n       |                                       |                       |\n       v                                       v                       v\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n|  1. NUMBER OF PASSES         |  2. INTERMEDIATE CODE FORMAT |  3. INTEGRATION LEVEL        |\n|  (1-Pass vs. 2-Pass)         |  (Variant I vs. Variant II)  |  (Separate vs. Integrated)   |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IINcKBn11Cxd1CsyGLFdt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7196.680085843296,
      "y": 5072.728382125758,
      "width": 1132.999267578125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 64046596,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 755756292,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789621609519,
      "created": 1789620315342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Parameter         | Single-Pass Assembler                  | Two-Pass Assembler                     |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Assembly Speed    | Fast: Scans source code only once;     | Slower: Requires two scans over        |\n|                   | no IC file I/O overhead                | source/IC files                        |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Target Output     | Must assemble target code directly     | Can stream target code to an           |\n|                   | into RAM (Load-and-Go)                 | external object file                   |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Forward           | Resolved via Backpatching              | Resolved naturally in Pass 2 using     |\n| References        | (TII / FRT fix-up chains)              | completed SYMTAB                       |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Complex           | Restricted: Forward references in      | Full Support: All symbols are evaluated|\n| Expressions       | expressions like X EQU A-B cannot      | after Pass 1 completes SYMTAB          |\n|                   | be backpatched easily                  |                                        |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Parameter         | Single-Pass Assembler                  | Two-Pass Assembler                     |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Assembly Speed    | Fast: Scans source code only once;     | Slower: Requires two scans over        |\n|                   | no IC file I/O overhead                | source/IC files                        |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Target Output     | Must assemble target code directly     | Can stream target code to an           |\n|                   | into RAM (Load-and-Go)                 | external object file                   |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Forward           | Resolved via Backpatching              | Resolved naturally in Pass 2 using     |\n| References        | (TII / FRT fix-up chains)              | completed SYMTAB                       |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+\n| Complex           | Restricted: Forward references in      | Full Support: All symbols are evaluated|\n| Expressions       | expressions like X EQU A-B cannot      | after Pass 1 completes SYMTAB          |\n|                   | be backpatched easily                  |                                        |\n+-------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
